<urn:atm:triage:finding/S8-RSH-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "S8-RSH-003" ;
  triage:title "Shutdown-concurrent waiter loop checks timed_out before shutdown flag" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/reconcile_runtime.rs:276 — The waiter loop at line 275 checks state.completed (line 276) before state.shutdown (line 282); the timeout guard (wait.1.timed_out()) is evaluated after wait_timeout returns (line 296). A concurrent shutdown that races with the condvar wake-up is not detected until the next loop iteration, creating a window where the caller may block for up to DEFAULT_RECONCILE_COMPLETION_TIMEOUT before the shutdown flag is seen. Pre-existing code: this file has zero changes in the S.8 sprint diff (feature/pS-s8-jsonl-compat vs integrate/phase-S). Team-lead disposition: Phase S backlog — address in a hardening sprint after phase-S integration." ;
  triage:category "RSH" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-S" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-05-09T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferralReason "Pre-existing issue — reconcile_runtime.rs not in S.8 sprint diff; team-lead ruled Phase S backlog" ;

